OL,3,GNEWSATeacher 'abused trust' by having
OL,4,Asex with pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "flirty" PE teacher "abused her
OL,7,Fposition of trust" by having sex with a
OL,8,F16-year-old student at her home, a
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FBronwen James, 30, of Chippenham in
OL,12,FWiltshire, is accused of four charges
OL,13,Fof sexual activity with a boy at
OL,14,FBitterne Park School in Southampton,
OL,15,FHampshire.
OL,17,FAt Winchester Crown Court on Thursday,
OL,18,FEdward Culver, prosecuting, told the
OL,19,Fjury how James allegedly told the boy
OL,20,Fshe loved him and wanted him to move
OL,21,Faway with her.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
