OL,4,Asex with pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a prepared statement she gave to
OL,7,Fpolice, James claimed the boy had been
OL,8,F"put up to make up these allegations
OL,9,Fagainst her by another student". She
OL,10,Fdenies all charges.
